  lines:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a95edc3eaf2a2854ead1879650d919e8, type: 2}
    text: "Hoan ngh\xEAnh \u0111\u1EBFn Qu\u1EF7 Th\u1ECB. \u1EDE th\u1EDDi k\u1EF3
      M\u1EA1t Ph\xE1p n\xE0y, v\xE0ng b\u1EA1c tr\u1EA7n th\u1EBF ch\u1EC9 l\xE0
      gi\u1EA5y v\u1EE5n. Linh th\u1EA1ch l\xE0 th\u1EE9 duy nh\u1EA5t c\xF3 gi\xE1
      tr\u1ECB giao d\u1ECBch."
    autoAdvance: 0
    autoAdvanceDelay: 0
    onStartEvent: 
    onEndEvent: 
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 78d4e64e81e4bf94a9f05d8e01f098b2, type: 2}
    text: "Chu\u1EA9n b\u1ECB xong ch\u01B0a? Ph\xEDa tr\u01B0\u1EDBc c\xF3 k\u1EBB
      \u0111ang \u0111\u1EE3i ng\u01B0\u01A1i."
